Review this Submilli package function before I publish it. The blueprint allows acme.com/messages.post only where channelId == ${vars.channelId}.

/**
 * Post a message.
 * @capability acme.com/messages.post { channelId: $input.channelId }
 */
export function postMessage(input: MessageInput): void {
    check("acme.com/messages.post", { channelId: input.channelId });
    post(BASE + "/messages", { channel: input.channelId, text: input.text }, headers());
}

MessageInput is an interface with channelId: string and text: string. Show the corrected function.
